    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/8a6b56aa6185cff82e25aab950b79e42.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span>As Quarta Amethyst, the strongest knight in the Quarta Order, battling Olicts is your responsibility. When you discover that they've set up a den in a forest near a settlement, it's time for you to take action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's behind the Olicts' increasing activity? What are their plans? Most importantly, can you put a stop to them without falling for their fiendish traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/20954ed4267c0b6b5300b468c843a842.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span>Play as a near-invulnerable magical knight in this turn-based RPG where it's the debuffs, not the damage, that pose the real threat. You'll have to explore multiple dungeons, do battle with the evil Olicts, and avoid their devious array of debuffs if you want to get to the bottom of their plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/aa4cf5e3d2a9b28fe1ac3735fe3242bb.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/e61d23df0fe945022b334aed367ad2e1.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/c11b16ac3e3ddf82c1bf85c535957b24.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/1d28f3fdd5e8a1d314a66fc173a09e3e.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/6ba5b3c5349fd1fb1d2baaf7f3c97504.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><strong>Invincible... Until You're Not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based RPG, you play as a near-invincible Quarta Knight, mowing down enemies with the greatest of ease. Unfortunately for you, the Olicts know your weakness: debuffs. When you're loaded down with enough of them, it becomes a struggle to even survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn the Tables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when the situation looks bleak, you have powerful options at your disposal. Escaping from a crisis is almost always possible, so long as you use your abilities wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps and Ambushes Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Olicts know that fighting you head-on is unwise, so they've prepared a plethora of devious traps to try to catch you off-guard. Can you see through their schemes, or will you brute-force your way through their dens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the game's dungeons, you'll see several visually distinct environments to delve into, each with its own unique Olict denizens to keep you on your toes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/8a6b56aa6185cff82e25aab950b79e42.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span>As Quarta Amethyst, the strongest knight in the Quarta Order, battling Olicts is your responsibility. When you discover that they've set up a den in a forest near a settlement, it's time for you to take action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's behind the Olicts' increasing activity? What are their plans? Most importantly, can you put a stop to them without falling for their fiendish traps?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/20954ed4267c0b6b5300b468c843a842.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span>Play as a near-invulnerable magical knight in this turn-based RPG where it's the debuffs, not the damage, that pose the real threat. You'll have to explore multiple dungeons, do battle with the evil Olicts, and avoid their devious array of debuffs if you want to get to the bottom of their plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/aa4cf5e3d2a9b28fe1ac3735fe3242bb.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/e61d23df0fe945022b334aed367ad2e1.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/c11b16ac3e3ddf82c1bf85c535957b24.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/1d28f3fdd5e8a1d314a66fc173a09e3e.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429870/extras/6ba5b3c5349fd1fb1d2baaf7f3c97504.avif?t=1749383591\" /></span><strong>Invincible... Until You're Not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based RPG, you play as a near-invincible Quarta Knight, mowing down enemies with the greatest of ease. Unfortunately for you, the Olicts know your weakness: debuffs. When you're loaded down with enough of them, it becomes a struggle to even survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn the Tables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when the situation looks bleak, you have powerful options at your disposal. Escaping from a crisis is almost always possible, so long as you use your abilities wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps and Ambushes Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Olicts know that fighting you head-on is unwise, so they've prepared a plethora of devious traps to try to catch you off-guard. Can you see through their schemes, or will you brute-force your way through their dens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the game's dungeons, you'll see several visually distinct environments to delve into, each with its own unique Olict denizens to keep you on your toes.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Olicts, dangerous monsters that prey upon human energy, have been suspiciously active lately. It's your job to find out why and to put a stop to their plans.",
